      "reason": "FrequencyRow.lean:767-774 assumes '0 < γ', 'γ < min (1 / 2) ((2 - α) / 2)', HomogCovariance and locally finite ν with open-ball growth and '0 ≤ C'. TeX integrated_wave_variance.tex:5-29 assumes H:homog, the identical strict γ range, positive Radon ν and C ≥ 0. HomogHypothesis.lean:64-80 matches notes_stratonovich_ham_second_moment.tex:169-186. The existential K precedes d and all measures; the supremum bound matches TeX:47-53, and integrability matches its proof:136-137. Ledger:1124 and claims.yaml:4620 are faithful."
